#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:7
#: 213cb16e13e54130a95d952cbe5fb39e
msgid ""
"Custom controller library allows you to implement and easily run your "
"controller inside ArduPilot in a systematic way. Original-primary-mains "
"means existing controller and custom-secondary means new controller. This "
"library aimed to not interfere with other parts of the main controller or "
"vehicle level code. The controller output is sent to the control allocation "
"library, known as the mixer, the same way the main controller does. The "
"custom controller library has the following features:"
msgstr ""
"自定义控制器库允许您以系统化的方式在 ArduPilot 中实现并轻松运行自己的控制器。original-primary-mains "
"指现有控制器，custom-secondary "
"指新控制器。该库旨在不干扰主控制器或飞行器层代码的其他部分。控制器输出通过与主控制器相同的方式发送到称为混控器的控制分配库。自定义控制器库具有以下特性："

