msgstr ""
"自定义控制器要求用户搭建构建环境（:ref:`building-the-code`）并在本地克隆 ArduPilot GitHub "
"仓库（:ref:`where-to-get-the-code`）。示例控制器仅供实验用途，仅经过轻度测试。建议用户在真实飞行器上测试时保持谨慎。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:37
#: 611751d1e6594068ab2eddc9613adb5f
msgid "Interaction With Main Controller"
msgstr "与主控制器的交互"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:38
#: cef1c07effe24669b29554aee495ef81
msgid ""
"The custom controller update function is called after the main rate "
"controller is run and before the motor output library is called. This "
"placement allows overriding motor library mixer input, namely ``_roll_in``, "
"``_pitch_in``, and ``_yaw_in`` values, without causing functional change "
"inside the motor library. This is the same way the main controller sends its"
" output to the control allocation library, known as a mixer. This reduces "
"latency to the minimum level."
msgstr ""
"自定义控制器的 update 函数在主速率控制器运行之后、电机输出库调用之前被调用。这一位置允许覆盖电机库混控器输入（即 "
"``_roll_in``、``_pitch_in`` 和 ``_yaw_in`` "
"值），而不会在电机库内部引起功能变化。这与主控制器向控制分配库（即混控器）发送输出的方式相同，将延迟降至最低。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:40
#: 2628be8569b74dde9585b3c9995c94af
msgid ""
"The custom controller library uses the same target attitude as the main "
"controller. Most of the code inside the ``AC_AttitudeControl`` library is "
"related to input shapings such as how to interpret pilot commands depending "
"on the flight mode or high-level position controller output. For example, in"
" STABILIZE mode pilot RC commands are scaled based on maximum lean angle and"
" yaw rate parameters, these values are passed to "
"``input_euler_angle_roll_pitch_euler_rate_yaw`` function. The pilot command "
"is fed into a first-order input shaping algorithm to smooth out any jitter "
"due to the RC link and to generate an acceleration-limited attitude target. "
"Later, attitude controller ``attitude_controller_run_quat`` is called, an "
"attitude error is calculated based on acceleration limited "
"``_attitude_target`` value, and target rate is generated. Even if "
"acceleration limiting is turned off by setting ``ATC_RATE_FF_ENAB`` to 0, "
"the target attitude is still presented with an ``_attitude_target`` "
"variable."
msgstr ""
"自定义控制器库使用与主控制器相同的目标姿态。``AC_AttitudeControl`` "
"库中大部分代码与输入整形有关，例如如何根据飞行模式或高层位置控制器输出解释飞手指令。例如，在 STABILIZE 模式下，飞手 RC "
"指令根据最大倾斜角和偏航速率参数进行缩放，这些值被传递给 ``input_euler_angle_roll_pitch_euler_rate_yaw``"
" 函数。飞手指令被送入一阶输入整形算法，以平滑 RC 链路引起的抖动并生成加速度限制的姿态目标。随后，姿态控制器 "
"``attitude_controller_run_quat`` 被调用，基于加速度限制的 ``_attitude_target`` "
"值计算姿态误差并生成目标角速率。即使通过将 ``ATC_RATE_FF_ENAB`` 设为 0 关闭加速度限制，目标姿态仍以 "
"``_attitude_target`` 变量呈现。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:42
#: 25ff09430c664f6fa576a4cc0e7b9101
msgid ""
"Every input shaping function inside ``AC_AttitudeControl`` calls "
"``attitude_controller_run_quat`` at the end to run the attitude controller, "
"except when flying in ACRO mode with the acro option set to rate only. Even "
"in this case ``_attitude_target`` is updated properly and the pilot command "
"can be accessed via the ``rate_bf_targets`` function."
msgstr ""
"``AC_AttitudeControl`` 内的每个输入整形函数最终都会调用 "
"``attitude_controller_run_quat``，只有在以 ACRO 模式飞行且 acro "
"选项设为仅速率时例外。即使在这种情况下，``_attitude_target`` 仍会被正确更新，飞手指令可通过 ``rate_bf_targets``"
" 函数访问。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:44
#: a06f5b8017434cc9b9696af7033207ec
msgid ""
"By default, the input shaping algorithm is turned on. This produces "
"kinematically consistent attitude target and rate feed-forward values. Take "
"a look at the custom PID backend to see how rate feed-forward is added to "
"the attitude controller output. It is advised to use the rate feed-forward "
"value if ATC_RATE_FF_ENAB is enabled, otherwise the pilot might feel "
"significant lag between RC commands and vehicle responses."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，输入整形算法处于开启状态，可产生运动学一致的姿态目标和速率前馈值。请参阅自定义 PID 后端，了解速率前馈如何添加到姿态控制器输出中。建议在"
" ATC_RATE_FF_ENAB 启用时使用速率前馈值，否则飞手可能会感受到 RC 指令与飞行器响应之间的明显延迟。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:46
#: d459cf0ee35040c0a27f2379c68cf4a8
msgid ""
"After running the custom controller, mixer input is sent to the motor "
"library via ``set_roll``, ``set_pitch``, ``set_yaw`` functions."
msgstr "运行自定义控制器后，混控器输入通过 ``set_roll``、``set_pitch``、``set_yaw`` 函数发送到电机库。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:50
#: 3bd630d4b04f4def99a2fadf21f59856
msgid "Bumpless Transfer"
msgstr "无冲击切换"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:52
#: c1d1660ee894410ab4fa4dac5e64bbbf
msgid ""
"When switching from the custom controller to the main controller it is "
"important to reset the main controller target, error, d-term filters, and "
"set each axis integrator properly. Otherwise, a sudden jump in the "
"controller error signal or motor output will be observed, which could result"
" in a jerky motion. To allow a smooth transition between controllers, the "
"main controller reset function is called when switching out of the custom "
"controller which reset all three axes of the main controller. The reset is "
"performed inside ``reset_main_atti_controller`` function."
msgstr ""
"从自定义控制器切换到主控制器时，重置主控制器目标、误差、微分项滤波器并正确设置各轴积分器非常重要。否则会出现控制器误差信号或电机输出的突变，可能导致飞行器突然抖动。为实现控制器间的平滑过渡，切出自定义控制器时会调用主控制器复位函数，重置所有三个轴的主控制器。复位在"
" ``reset_main_atti_controller`` 函数中执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:54
#: 959b59bb25a849b2b9547884ec124930
msgid ""
"The attitude target and rate target are also made equal to the current "
"attitude and gyro rate to make the error signal grow from zero in the "
"``relax_attitude_controllers`` function. To avoid impulse input to the "
"controller, the target resetting is not performed when the feedforward is "
"disabled by setting :ref:`ATC_RATE_FF_ENAB<ATC_RATE_FF_ENAB>` parameter to "
"0."
msgstr ""
"姿态目标和速率目标也会被设为等于当前姿态和陀螺仪角速率，使误差信号在 ``relax_attitude_controllers`` "
"函数中从零开始增长。为避免对控制器产生冲击输入，当通过将 :ref:`ATC_RATE_FF_ENAB<ATC_RATE_FF_ENAB>` 参数设为 "
"0 禁用前馈时，不执行目标复位。"

