#: 4c407691c8554c0e9642343f5f37e22b
msgid "Empty backend set :ref:`CC_TYPE<CC_TYPE>` = 1"
msgstr "空后端，设置 :ref:`CC_TYPE<CC_TYPE>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:77
#: 2e38b3b390ac4bd2926a0e50f06a18da
msgid "PID backend set :ref:`CC_TYPE<CC_TYPE>` = 2"
msgstr "PID 后端，设置 :ref:`CC_TYPE<CC_TYPE>` = 2"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:81
#: 74a0507cd1554896a25e35040267ed7a
msgid "Empty Controller - :ref:`CC_TYPE<CC_TYPE>` = 1"
msgstr "空控制器 - :ref:`CC_TYPE<CC_TYPE>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:83
#: 4d3fee9f51484f79b4f059e710846e3a
msgid ""
"The empty controller does not do any calculations. It is created to make it "
"easier to copy and implement your new controller. The main controller is not"
" reset when switching from an empty controller."
msgstr "空控制器不进行任何计算。它的创建是为了方便复制和实现新控制器。从空控制器切出时不会重置主控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:88
#: 019fe05ad93b457baf3fe5d3d5ff2ff6
msgid "PID Controller - :ref:`CC_TYPE<CC_TYPE>` = 2"
msgstr "PID 控制器 - :ref:`CC_TYPE<CC_TYPE>` = 2"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:90
#: 507c9571481f467e98cc69839684e456
msgid ""
"The PID controller backend has the same controller architecture as the main "
"controller. It doesn't have any safeguarding mechanism such as acceleration "
"limiting or rate limiting. The default gains are scaled 0.9 times to "
"differentiate the custom controller response from the main one. Since this "
"controller does not have acceleration limiting, specifically a square root "
"controller, it would be safer to give a gentle command while flying with it."
" Although it has the same architecture as the main one, a proper reset "
"functionality is not implemented intentionally to make it easier to detect "
"the effect of improper resetting."
msgstr ""
"PID 控制器后端与主控制器具有相同的控制器架构。它没有任何安全保护机制，如加速度限制或速率限制。默认增益按 0.9 "
"倍缩放，以区分自定义控制器与主控制器的响应。由于该控制器没有加速度限制（特别是平方根控制器），在飞行时给出平缓指令会更安全。虽然架构与主控制器相同，但有意未实现完整的复位功能，以便更容易检测不当复位的影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:93
#: c7c6b029bc974e248a8a8bd39416e4e0
msgid "How To Use It"
msgstr "使用方法"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:95
#: 6f3bb4ea37d04fd3a81f4dabcd56e76f
msgid ""
"The custom controller is enabled by default in SITL. You can test it using "
"the PID backend."
msgstr "自定义控制器在 SITL 中默认启用。可使用 PID 后端进行测试。"

