"开关。重启自动驾驶仪。例如在 MAVProxy 中，使用 RC 通道 6 作为自定义控制器的启用/禁用开关："

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:106
#: c7675fb56caa404f9112f53a6c9e291c
msgid ""
"**Step #2:** Run the following command to display backend parameters. These "
"would be under ``CC2_`` for the PID backend."
msgstr "**步骤 #2：** 运行以下命令显示后端参数。PID 后端对应参数以 ``CC2_`` 开头。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:112
#: 612ae699e55e46739c7c9890b351bf3e
msgid ""
"**Step #3:** Arm and take off. While hovering, switch RC6 to high. In "
"MAVProxy, you can do this with"
msgstr "**步骤 #3：** 解锁并起飞。悬停时，将 RC6 拨到高位。在 MAVProxy 中可执行"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:118
#: cbfe2c49f2174ab4ad52eab4bbd8e8a1
msgid ""
"**Step #4:** You should be prompted with ``Custom controller is ON`` message"
" on GCS to indicate that the custom controller is running."
msgstr "**步骤 #4：** 地面站应提示 ``Custom controller is ON`` 消息，表明自定义控制器正在运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:120
#: 5be6f02068fe4468b5c7577ef333039d
msgid ""
"**Step #5:** Set RC6 to low to switch back to the main controller. You "
"should be prompted with ``Custom controller is OFF`` message on GCS."
msgstr "**步骤 #5：** 将 RC6 拨低以切换回主控制器。地面站应提示 ``Custom controller is OFF`` 消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:124
#: 524303d9feb341dd9e76ccdbcd9c4419
msgid "Real Flight Testing"
msgstr "实机飞行测试"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:126
#: 0290e645c9d1414f9450bb07648838db
msgid ""
"It is recommended that you always arm, take-off, land, and disarm while the "
"main controller is running. You should switch to the custom controller while"
" the vehicle is hovering steadily. This will reduce the effect of improper "
"filter resetting. You should arm and take off with the custom controller "
"only if proper ground idling is implemented."
msgstr ""
"建议始终在主控制器运行时完成解锁、起飞、降落和加锁操作。应在飞行器平稳悬停时切换到自定义控制器，以减少滤波器复位不当的影响。只有在实现了正确地面怠速功能的情况下，才能用自定义控制器解锁和起飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:128
#: a66db1a3d4864a92960e7e3af78b85ef
msgid ""
"To test it on hardware compile with the ``--enable-custom-controller`` flag."
msgstr "要在硬件上测试，请使用 ``--enable-custom-controller`` 标志编译。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:135
#: a3bdab987d964a399056898c89b55faf
msgid "Post Flight Logs"
msgstr "飞行后日志"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:137
#: d782e0c4cb534f7d8d24219c67ca7098
msgid ""
"Switching in and out of the custom controller is logged under the \"CC\" in "
"the log tree. You can see the time and duration the custom controller is "
"activated under \"CC.Act\""
msgstr "自定义控制器的切入切出记录在日志树的「CC」下。可在「CC.Act」下查看自定义控制器激活的时间和持续时长"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:140
#: 39988e60a8b04ca7bd362a1b7c0e6bcc
msgid "How To Add New Custom Controller"
msgstr "如何添加新的自定义控制器"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:142
#: 7dba2b07b18a4b2bbba1e9bd9db034c3
