"文件中，将所有类名、函数定义等从 ``AC_CustomControl_Empty`` 改为 "
"``AC_CustomControl_XYZ``。头文件示例如下"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:206
#: ba07e07a61b247cd8616613201601000
msgid ""
"**Step #4:** Increase the maximum number of custom control variables by one "
"and update the custom control type enum"
msgstr "**步骤 #4：** 将自定义控制变量的最大数量加一，并更新自定义控制类型枚举"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:208
#: 753c9e63df8d480eb698c485fe0b380e
msgid "from"
msgstr "从"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:214
#: e4b005d6078b416395cb34bd004cfff7
msgid "to"
msgstr "改为"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:229
#: b6492e3945314c6fb7cfe70c32c5d53b
msgid ""
"**Step #5:** Add a new backend header in ``AC_CustomControl.cpp`` file. "
"Place it under other backend includes."
msgstr ""
"**步骤 #5：** 在 ``AC_CustomControl.cpp`` 文件中添加新的后端头文件，放在其他后端 include 语句下方。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:238
#: 5ee31b3b1f444ff8bc2542e06257d6a9
msgid ""
"**Step #6:** Add new backend parameter in ``AC_CustomControl.cpp`` file. "
"Increment ``_backend_var_info`` array index, backend parameter prefix and "
"parameter table index by one. Place it under the other backend's parameters."
msgstr ""
"**步骤 #6：** 在 ``AC_CustomControl.cpp`` 文件中添加新的后端参数。将 ``_backend_var_info`` "
"数组索引、后端参数前缀和参数表索引各加一。放在其他后端参数的下方。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:257
#: 557b097e49aa40c9b62eeb98e9d33588
msgid ""
"**Step #7:** Allow creating new backend class in ``AC_CustomControl.cpp`` "
"file inside init function."
msgstr "**步骤 #7：** 在 ``AC_CustomControl.cpp`` 文件的 init 函数内允许创建新的后端类。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:276
#: 6af40d6ea3d64c448da94d6f0da75fa8
msgid ""
"**Step #8:** Add the custom controller in ``AC_CustomControl_config.h`` "
"file."
msgstr "**步骤 #8：** 在 ``AC_CustomControl_config.h`` 文件中添加自定义控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:284
#: dd768ba6dea44334909b6c8d4ee7394d
msgid ""
"**Step #9:** This is the bare minimum to compile and run your custom "
"controller. You can add controller-related code to the "
"``AC_CustomControl_XYZ`` file without changing anything else."
msgstr ""
"**步骤 #9：** 这是编译和运行自定义控制器的最低要求。可以在 ``AC_CustomControl_XYZ`` "
"文件中添加控制器相关代码，无需修改其他内容。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:286
#: cc26781c47af4d619f0c80af93793f48
msgid ""
"**Step #10:** You can add new parameters by following the instructions in "
"the `Adding a parameter to a library <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/code-"
"overview-adding-a-new-parameter.html#adding-a-parameter-to-a-library>`__ "
"wiki page."
msgstr ""
"**步骤 #10：** 可按照 `向库添加参数 <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/code-overview-"
"adding-a-new-parameter.html#adding-a-parameter-to-a-library>`__ wiki "
"页面的说明添加新参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:290
#: 1e1267b315d54be2b4dfba9a54f15e12
msgid ""
"**Step #11:** Initialize the class object in the backend's constructor. For "
"example in PID backend"
msgstr "**步骤 #11：** 在后端的构造函数中初始化类对象。例如在 PID 后端中"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:306
#: d2fc7ada26e64d7698669f7e306f8de9
msgid "above P or PID classes are initialized in the backend's constructors,"
msgstr "上述 P 或 PID 类在后端的构造函数中初始化，"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:322
#: 427efbe4b5bc454684de8611d7b5d95c
msgid ""
"**Step #12:** Add your controller inside update function of "
"``AC_CustomControl_XYZ.cpp`` file. This function returns a 3-dimensional "
"vector consisting of roll, pitch, yaw, and mixer input, respectively."
msgstr ""
"**步骤 #12：** 在 ``AC_CustomControl_XYZ.cpp`` 文件的 update "
"函数中添加控制器代码。该函数返回一个三维向量，依次包含横滚、俯仰、偏航和混控器输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:324
#: 4dd3145d33b946d2bc43e9d898fc32a8
msgid ""
"**Step #13:** Add reset functionality inside reset function of "
"``AC_CustomControl_XYZ.cpp`` file. It is the user's responsibility to add "
"proper controller resetting functionality. This highly depends on the "
"controller and it should not be copy-pasted from another backend without "
"testing it in SITL."
msgstr ""
"**步骤 #13：** 在 ``AC_CustomControl_XYZ.cpp`` 文件的 reset "
"函数中添加复位功能。添加正确的控制器复位功能是用户的责任，这高度依赖于具体控制器，不应在未经 SITL 测试的情况下从其他后端直接复制粘贴。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:326
#: a5c28406b8ba4bb3bda9abc690f19591
msgid ""
"**Step #14:** You can access target attitude and target rate values using "
"``atti_control->get_attitude_target_quat()`` and "
"``atti_control->rate_bf_targets()`` functions, respectively. You can also "
"access latest gyro measurement using ``_ahrs->get_gyro_latest()`` function."
msgstr ""
"**步骤 #14：** 可分别使用 ``atti_control->get_attitude_target_quat()`` 和 "
"``atti_control->rate_bf_targets()`` 函数访问目标姿态和目标角速率值。也可使用 "
"``_ahrs->get_gyro_latest()`` 函数访问最新的陀螺仪测量值。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:330
#: 1a6421b59c0949d18dc0b5f63c3798b5
msgid "Preparing Your Simulink Model For Code Generation"
msgstr "为代码生成准备 Simulink 模型"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:332
#: a0f7965de7824147be60af642152a3d3
msgid ""
"Simulink model of the controller needs to be configured before the code "
"generation. These steps are demonstrated in the following video."
msgstr "控制器的 Simulink 模型在代码生成前需要进行配置。以下视频演示了这些步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:337
#: 7d19c48f74cb4c8d9533d971d2f9b224
msgid ""
"**Step #1:** In Solver tab in Configuration, change solver type to Fixed-"
"Type. This is mandatory for code generation to work. Change Solver to "
"discrete(no continuous state) this will reduce generated code's flash cost "
"and run-time load. Change Fixed-step size to one over the "
":ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>`. The code generation needs to be "
"repeated each time this parameter is changed."
msgstr ""
"**步骤 #1：** 在「配置」的「求解器」选项卡中，将求解器类型更改为「Fixed-Type」。这是代码生成正常工作的必要条件。将求解器更改为 "
"discrete（无连续状态），以减少生成代码的 Flash 占用和运行时负载。将固定步长更改为 "
":ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>` 的倒数。每次更改此参数后需要重新进行代码生成。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:339
#: f591d2506d224ae1bac4f551ac56865a
msgid ""
"**Step #2:** In the Hardware Implementation tab, change Device vendor to ARM"
" Compatible and Device type to ARM Cortex-M. This determines which data "
"types are available and what is their size."
msgstr ""
"**步骤 #2：** 在「硬件实现」选项卡中，将设备供应商更改为「ARM Compatible」，设备类型更改为「ARM "
"Cortex-M」。这决定了可用的数据类型及其大小。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:341
#: c75dca25dd29447dace6c7e7950e689c
msgid ""
"**Step #3:** In the Code Generation tab, change the System target file to "
"ert.tlc Embedded Coder and language to C++. Since we don't want Simulink to "
"compile the generated code click Generate code only. Click Package code and "
"artifacts to get only relevant generated code files in a single folder."
msgstr ""
"**步骤 #3：** 在「代码生成」选项卡中，将系统目标文件更改为 ert.tlc Embedded Coder，语言更改为 C++。由于不希望 "
"Simulink 编译生成的代码，点击「仅生成代码」。点击「打包代码和工件」以将所有相关生成代码文件集中到一个文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:343
#: 1c6d3795ed5148ebb986edfebd73fbfc
msgid ""
"**Step #4:** In Code Generation->Optimization tab, change Default parameter "
"behavior to Tunable. This will create a variable inside the generated code "
"with the same name as they are defined in Matlab or Simulink workspace."
msgstr ""
"**步骤 #4：** 在「代码生成」->「优化」选项卡中，将「默认参数行为」更改为「Tunable」。这将在生成代码中创建与 Matlab 或 "
"Simulink 工作区中定义名称相同的变量。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:345
#: 4f178e38aa8542e5b48706619556b05a
msgid ""
"**Step #5:** To force generated code to be strictly single precision, change"
" Inport and Outport block data type to single. Since mathematical operation "
"in ArduPilot runs in single precision."
msgstr ""
"**步骤 #5：** 为强制生成代码严格使用单精度，将 Inport 和 Outport 块的数据类型更改为 single。因为 ArduPilot "
"中的数学运算以单精度进行。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:347
#: 7f32d0d84d254fe2819e5725ffe4c19a
msgid ""
"**Step #6:** In Code Mapping->Data, change Inport and Outport data "
"visibility to public, and member access method to none. This will allow "
"passing input and output as an argument."
msgstr ""
"**步骤 #6：** 在「代码映射」->「数据」中，将 Inport 和 Outport 的数据可见性更改为 public，成员访问方式更改为 "
"none。这将允许将输入和输出作为参数传递。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:349
#: b410e76ba0c84325a64d350a7aed4209
msgid ""
"**Step #7:** In Code Mappings->Data, change Model parameters data visibility"
" to public. This will allow accessing model parameters inside the custom "
"controller backend."
msgstr ""
"**步骤 #7：** 在「代码映射」->「数据」中，将「模型参数数据可见性」更改为 public。这将允许在自定义控制器后端中访问模型参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:351
#: 4bd8dd1b901143aa834071c578dc227b
msgid ""
"**Step #8:** In Code Mappings->Functions, change step function input and "
"output argument type. If these are changed to pointer as shown in the video,"
" step 6 is mandatory. The choice of how to pass input and output depends on "
"the user's preference. Inputs are passed by pointer and outputs passed by "
"reference for simplicity."
msgstr ""
"**步骤 #8：** 在「代码映射」->「函数」中，更改 step 函数的输入输出参数类型。如视频所示改为指针类型，则步骤 6 "
"为必须。输入输出的传递方式取决于用户偏好。为简单起见，输入通过指针传递，输出通过引用传递。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:353
#: 488a3bbcb89e40f8af9cd62f2b065826
msgid ""
"**Step #9:** The last step is to click on generate code button to start code"
" generation. If a problem arises during this process, Simulink will throw an"
" error message to explain the problem and how to fix it."
msgstr ""
"**步骤 #9：** 最后一步是点击「生成代码」按钮开始代码生成。如果在此过程中出现问题，Simulink 将给出错误消息说明问题及修复方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:355
#: d06b85d7821c425cbf38018bfa3c8811
msgid ""
"There are a lot of options in Simulink code generation in terms of class, "
"function, variable naming, code generation optimization level, parameters "
"access and storage method, etc. It is up to the user to change these "
"depending on their project needs."
msgstr "Simulink 代码生成在类名、函数名、变量命名、代码优化级别、参数访问和存储方式等方面有很多选项，用户可根据项目需求自行调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:358
#: 7c345e0c589f42f38dff4424b23a71d1
msgid ""
"Please watch the following video to understand what each generated header "
"and cpp files contain."
msgstr "请观看以下视频，了解每个生成的头文件和 cpp 文件的内容。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:365
#: c0cd816e7b2249969820c5a174991a41
msgid "Integration Generated Code Into ArduPilot"
msgstr "将生成代码集成到 ArduPilot 中"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:367
#: 6c4eec7703aa4f05b4e8b894d3cbb6a8
msgid ""
"The generated source code needs to be copied inside the ArduPilot and called"
" inside the newly created custom controller backend. The steps to achieve "
"this is demonstrated in the following video."
msgstr "生成的源代码需要复制到 ArduPilot 中，并在新创建的自定义控制器后端中调用。以下视频演示了实现步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:372
#: f07dc4f3a9c746529c72fea9e3ce95f0
msgid ""
"**Step #1:** Copy content of zip file into a new folder inside "
"ardupilot/libraries. Call AC_Simulink as in the example. **Step #2:** Tell "
"waf to build this folder if the custom controller is enabled. **Step #3:** "
"Create an object of simulink code generated class. **Step #4:** Call "
"initialize function of this object inside backend constructer. **Step #5:** "
"Call step function of this object inside backend update function. Arrange "
"input and output arguments by following the similar pattern as in "
"ert_main.cpp. **Step #6:** Once these steps are completed we can compile "
"ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"**步骤 #1：** 将 zip 文件内容复制到 ardupilot/libraries 内的新文件夹中，命名为 "
"AC_Simulink（示例中）。**步骤 #2：** 如果启用了自定义控制器，告知 waf 构建该文件夹。**步骤 #3：** 创建 Simulink"
" 代码生成类的对象。**步骤 #4：** 在后端构造函数中调用该对象的 initialize 函数。**步骤 #5：** 在后端 update "
"函数中调用该对象的 step 函数，按照 ert_main.cpp 中的类似模式整理输入输出参数。**步骤 #6：** 完成上述步骤后即可编译 "
"ArduPilot。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:379
#: d522d636a4d740a1931c75f586582a4e
msgid ""
"As long as the input and output type and how they are passed to the step "
"function remain the same, the steps given in here and in the previous "
"section do not need to be repeated each time we do code generation. Even if "
"we change the controller type for example from P+PID to PID+PID, we just "
"need to click on the generate code button and copy and paste the zip file "
"content to the AC_Simulink folder."
msgstr ""
"只要传递给 step 函数的输入输出类型和方式不变，每次代码生成时不需要重复此处和上一节给出的步骤。即使控制器类型从 P+PID 改为 "
"PID+PID，也只需点击「生成代码」按钮，将 zip 文件内容复制粘贴到 AC_Simulink 文件夹即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-adding-custom-controller.rst:381
#: 9287c8b6646f48f79b669e05a2d2dce7
msgid ""
"An example of this implementation is given in this PR "
"https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/pull/21700."
msgstr "该实现的示例见此 PR：https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/pull/21700。"
